    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa intrappola il bersaglio in una tempesta\ndi sabbia per quattro o cinque turni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user traps the target inside a harshly raging\nsandstorm for four to five turns.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激しく　吹きあれる　砂あらしの\n中に　４ー５ターンの　間\n相手を　閉じこめて　攻撃する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将对手困在\n铺天盖地的沙暴中，\n在４～５回合内进行攻击。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Enreda al objetivo en un remolino de arena de cuatro a\ncinco turnos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
